      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"QueryMethodParameterConversionException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>QueryMethodParameterConversionException</code></a> for the given source object, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a>\nand root cause <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionException</code></a>.",
